    mistakes to avoid:\r\n\r\n\u2014 Missing WORLD header \u2192 file will not load\r\n\u2014
    Comma instead of dot in decimals \u2192 parse error  \r\n\u2014 Brackets left
    in tick lines \u2192 remove [ and ]\r\n\u2014 Empty lines between ticks \u2192
    remove them\r\n\u2014 Wrong number of values per line \u2192 must be exactly
