      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "WORLD header fields:\r\n\r\nminX / maxX     \u2014 horizontal grid bounds\r\nminY
    / maxY     \u2014 vertical grid bounds\r\ncenterLon       \u2014 longitude of
    the grid center\r\ncenterLat       \u2014 latitude of the grid center\r\npatchWidth     
    \u2014 width of one cell in meters\r\npatchHeight     \u2014 height of one cell
    in meters\r\n\r\nTick data fields:\r\n\r\ntick            \u2014 simulation step
    number, starts at 0\r\nx               \u2014 agent column position on the grid\r\ny              
    \u2014 agent row position on the grid\r\n\r\nAll values are space-separated.
    \r\nDecimal numbers use a dot, not a comma."
