  m_text: "Your simulation file must follow this structure. \r\nThe WORLD header
    defines the grid, followed by tick-by-tick agent data.\r\n\r\nWORLD  minX  maxX 
    minY  maxY  centerLon  centerLat  patchWidth patchHeight\r\n\r\n[tick] [x] [y]\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\nWORLD
    -25 25 -25 25 37.6173 55.7558 5.0 5.0\r\n0 -12 4\r\n0 -11 4\r\n0 -11 5\r\n1 -12
    3\r\n1 -10 4\r\n\r\nEach line after WORLD represents one agent \r\nat a given
    tick with its grid coordinates."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
